{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"KL公理"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"综合微分几何","text":"综合微分几何"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Kock–Lawvere 公理"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>在"},{"Local":{"url":"综合微分几何","text":"综合微分几何"}},{"Plain":"中, 记 $D$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"一阶无穷小线段","text":"一阶无穷小线段"}},{"Plain":", $R$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"直线(SDG)","text":"直线"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>关于 $D$ 的 Kock–Lawvere 公理陈述如下.</p>\n<p><strong>公理</strong>. 对任意函数 $f\\colon D\\to R$, 存在唯一的 $a,b\\in R$, 使得对任意 $d\\in D$,\n$$\r\nf(d) = a + d \\cdot b.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}